description=PICO 4 Motion Tracker 2.0.5 unlock for PICO 4 standard (ROM 5.13.x). v2.8 CRITICAL FIX: native compat libs moved OUT of /system/lib64 into the priv-app private nativeLibraryDir (v2.7's global mount made openxr_runtime crash-loop -> 447 tombstones -> black screen; verified fixed, 0 tombstones). Stock PICO-signed APK untouched. Single build, stock scheduling. Tracker detection works (3 devices verified). Reboot after install.
